{"id":"MOEX-113020-1301-Q088","title":"澱粉水解可經麥芽糖，最終以葡萄糖吸收","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med1","sourceSha256":"311766a008de4cd486451d5cf3ace651e21626ab07aac13eb730273a6bb8da80","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_b848a20b2aa881918b9ed1a6290c803d","sourceAnchor":"q88","shortHtml":"<p>答案為 <strong>A：葡萄糖（glucose）與麥芽糖（maltose）</strong>。兩者都會出現在飲食澱粉的消化歷程中；不過<strong>麥芽糖是中間產物，完全消化並吸收時以葡萄糖為主</strong>，不能把A讀成「完整麥芽糖也直接被一般單糖運輸路徑吸收」。</p>","html":"<div><h2>澱粉水解可經麥芽糖，最終以葡萄糖吸收</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：A</p><p>答案為 <strong>A：葡萄糖（glucose）與麥芽糖（maltose）</strong>。兩者都會出現在飲食澱粉的消化歷程中；不過<strong>麥芽糖是中間產物，完全消化並吸收時以葡萄糖為主</strong>，不能把A讀成「完整麥芽糖也直接被一般單糖運輸路徑吸收」。</p>\n<h3>澱粉先拆成短片段，再拆到單糖</h3>\n<p><strong>直鏈澱粉（amylose）</strong>主要由葡萄糖以α-1,4糖苷鍵連成長鏈；<strong>支鏈澱粉（amylopectin）</strong>除了α-1,4主鏈，還有α-1,6分支點。兩者的單糖組成都是葡萄糖，差別在連結與分支方式。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1580px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.2845528455284554\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/bfdb4eb116bf30834066bb7e9c9a0c99bbf32f3ef3b2ab530131aba26d2fd5f7.png\" alt=\"直鏈與支鏈澱粉：可讀的α(1→4)與α(1→6)化學面板\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1580\" height=\"1230\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/bfdb4eb116bf30834066bb7e9c9a0c99bbf32f3ef3b2ab530131aba26d2fd5f7.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>上方是amylose（直鏈澱粉）的完整化學示意，青綠色1與4指出α(1→4)連結；下方是amylopectin（支鏈澱粉），青綠色1與6指出α(1→6)分支。兩者都是葡萄糖聚合物，消化水解不會直接產生磷酸化葡萄糖。 圖：OpenStax／Rice University，Biology 2e；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-2e/pages/3-2-carbohydrates\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。節錄原圖兩個完整化學區塊，等比例上下排列；裁切與排版紀錄見圖像索引。</figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>化學式中的綠色<strong>1、4</strong>標出主鏈相接碳位；下方分支的<strong>1、6</strong>顯示分支鍵。這解釋了為何α-澱粉酶切開主鏈後，仍有分支片段要由刷狀緣酵素處理。</p>\n<p>唾液與胰臟的<strong>α-澱粉酶</strong>水解α-1,4鍵，產生麥芽糖、麥芽三糖及帶有分支的<strong>α極限糊精</strong>等片段。它不能直接把α-1,6分支點全部切開，所以後續仍需要小腸刷狀緣酵素接手。</p>\n<p>刷狀緣的<strong>麥芽糖酶–葡萄糖澱粉酶</strong>與<strong>蔗糖酶–異麥芽糖酶</strong>等，進一步處理α-1,4連結及分支相關連結，最後釋出可吸收的葡萄糖。麥芽糖含兩個葡萄糖單位，因此是「已部分消化」，還不是單糖。</p>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1019px;--reviewed-image-ratio:2.3533487297921476\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/546be795edaa7d945c0f04ade90f2a5a8ff5650e01d8fea876e8e503f38fe5f0.png\" alt=\"澱粉水解先出現短鏈與麥芽糖\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1019\" height=\"433\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/546be795edaa7d945c0f04ade90f2a5a8ff5650e01d8fea876e8e503f38fe5f0.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>胰澱粉酶先把澱粉拆成較短多糖及麥芽糖等。 圖：Alice Callahan，Nutrition: Science and Everyday Application；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://openoregon.pressbooks.pub/nutritionscience2e/chapter/4c-digestion-absorption-carbohydrates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。原PNG透明背景等尺寸合成白底，無裁切、改標、重畫；透明原檔另存。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:679px;--reviewed-image-ratio:4.380645161290323\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/3bab5c1d9f7908dd14e4f28b9bb9bf1711f33b449ce7de12bfec72cf1a054455.png\" alt=\"麥芽糖再水解成兩個葡萄糖\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"679\" height=\"155\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/3bab5c1d9f7908dd14e4f28b9bb9bf1711f33b449ce7de12bfec72cf1a054455.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>麥芽糖酶再把一個麥芽糖拆成兩個葡萄糖。 圖：Alice Callahan，Nutrition: Science and Everyday Application；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://openoregon.pressbooks.pub/nutritionscience2e/chapter/4c-digestion-absorption-carbohydrates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。原PNG透明背景等尺寸合成白底；採原網站獨立圖檔，未裁切或重畫。</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>兩張圖接著讀：第一張是<strong>長鏈→較短片段與麥芽糖</strong>，第二張才是<strong>麥芽糖→兩個單糖葡萄糖</strong>。因此A同時列出消化中間物與最後可吸收的單糖，而不是說麥芽糖能原封不動地由單糖運輸路徑吸收。</p>\n<h3>為何其他選項的磷酸糖不對？</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>反應類型</th><th>典型情境</th><th>與本題的差別</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>水解</strong></td><td>消化道酵素以水切開糖苷鍵</td><td>本題；可見麥芽糖等中間物，最後形成葡萄糖</td></tr>\n<tr><td>磷酸解</td><td>細胞內糖原磷酸化酶利用無機磷酸切下糖單位</td><td>常形成葡萄糖-1-磷酸，並非消化道澱粉水解</td></tr>\n<tr><td>磷酸化</td><td>細胞內把葡萄糖轉成葡萄糖-6-磷酸</td><td>屬代謝入口步驟，不是腸腔澱粉水解直接產物</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>B與C的<strong>葡萄糖-1-磷酸</strong>混入了磷酸解概念；D的<strong>葡萄糖-6-磷酸</strong>則混入細胞內磷酸化。題目明確說飲食澱粉在消化道中被「水解」，所以A最適當。</p>\n<h3>考法改一個字，回答層次就不同</h3>\n<p>若問<strong>完全消化後的單糖</strong>，應答葡萄糖；若問<strong>α-澱粉酶的主要產物</strong>，應想到麥芽糖、麥芽三糖與α極限糊精。這題給的是整段消化歷程的產物配對，A符合，而不是要求列出所有中間物。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（一）原題，第88題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：更正後答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.naspghan.org/files/documents/pdfs/training/curriculum-resources/physiology-series/Carbohydrate_digestion_NASPGHAN.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASPGHAN Physiology Education Series: Carbohydrate Digestion and Absorption</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/6605901/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jones et al., Gut 1983: Glucose absorption from starch hydrolysates in the human jejunum</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-2e/pages/3-2-carbohydrates\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax／Rice University，Biology 2e：直鏈與支鏈澱粉：可讀的α(1→4)與α(1→6)化學面板</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openoregon.pressbooks.pub/nutritionscience2e/chapter/4c-digestion-absorption-carbohydrates/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alice Callahan，Nutrition: Science and Everyday Application：澱粉水解先出現短鏈與麥芽糖</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":3,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：A"}